48779057397", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75435284_2177448782390730_428727588116910256_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wMramIIbdWgQ7kNvwENRZnF&_nc_oc=AdnVWAGzLDtLKlXdTbEhEQBr_POhsw0nL7U2PPS66N24qoi_VKEMysiBGJW2RzBSD4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuflW_aCXsGm2wR47_JPdwfiGCz-Ma08alw5JgfeQPqrQ&oe=69A04AE6"}, {"file_name": "SDTool01.png", "id": "1281429298906003", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75340705_1281429302239336_4781847839353527208_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cHTGDpk9nloQ7kNvwGLLqXk&_nc_oc=AdmAuAI9kBG60fq5l82OKJACVV1kO8KBMw8YZrwc_VGRj06soWrPmRxZSNoKS_mMnwE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft8c_3PVRidYsmwHKI__EukX-l4k6Okwrnt7VU51Lzqaw&oe=69A04444"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Drops Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "DROPS VR is an initiative by the DROPS Asia Chapter administered by Drilling VR to create a free Virtual Reality based awareness training and collaboration tool.\n\nStudents will learn through a series of real world simulated assignments to\n\n - Understand the potential of dropped objects\n - Recognize common causes of dropped objects\n - Methods for preventing dropped objects and preventing harm\n - Become familiar with reference tools and publications of the DROPS Forum\n\nDROPS is all about collaboration and the DROPS VR will be a tool where members can\n\n - Virtually remotely meet in a range of Industrial simulated environments\n - Interact with the Virtual Environment by pointing at and moving objects\n - Speak with each other through a multiplayer avatar system\n - Designed for subject matter experts to meet and collaborate for the prevention of dropped objects", "short_description": "Virtual Reality environment to learn about dropped object prevention."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dropsvr.org/privacy/"